{"book":"jeremiah","num":5,"verses":[{"en":"Run ye to and fro through the streets of Jerusalem, and see now, and know, and seek in the broad places thereof, if ye can find a man, if there be any that executeth judgment, that seeketh the truth; and I will pardon it.","n":1,"sm":"Ierusalema, ma ia vaavaai, ma ia iloa, ma ia outou sailiili i ona malae, pe tou te maua ai se tagata, pe ai se tasi ua ia faia le mea tonu, ma ua taumafai ina ia faamaoni, ona ou faamagaloina ai lea o le aai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ierusalema,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"vaavaai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"iloa,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"sailiili"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"malae,"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"tou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"maua"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata,"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"tonu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"taumafai"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaoni,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"faamagaloina"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aai."}]},{"en":"And though they say, The LORD liveth; surely they swear falsely.","n":2,"sm":"E ui lava ina ua latou faapea mai, O loo soifua le ALII; a ua latou tauto pepelo lava.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"ui"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"soifua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm